WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.761
CivicWorks Automation Lab. Eight data pipelines for invented organisations. Each one takes messy data, catches the problems, stops where a person must decide,

00:00:06.761 --> 00:00:13.272
and leaves evidence of everything it did.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:24.016
Atlas License Directory. A monthly printed directory that is checked, frozen, printed, verified and published - and can be rolled back.

00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:33.311
OpenBadge Registry Publisher. A public data file that only goes live after it has been fetched back and proven identical.

00:00:34.717 --> 00:00:43.582
Regional Programs Analytics. Quarterly Excel reports that refuse approval while the data is incomplete, and freeze once approved.

00:00:44.983 --> 00:00:53.708
LedgerGuard Data Quality. Daily export checks that never mistake an empty file for success, with archives you can safely restore.

00:00:55.117 --> 00:01:06.375
SafeSite Compliance Cycle. A quarterly safety-return cycle - reminders, checks, escalations and two Word reports - with nothing sent and no final overwritten.

00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:18.100
MasterRecord Steward. Master records from three disagreeing sources - justified changes approved, the rest held for a person, nothing else touched.

00:01:19.517 --> 00:01:27.579
ReconcileHub. Monthly access-roster reconciliation that suggests near-matches and never merges two people on a guess.

00:01:28.983 --> 00:01:39.972
OpsPilot Control Center. One control room over the other pipelines - planned, checkpointed, approved by people, and unable to exceed its contracts.

00:01:41.383 --> 00:01:50.591
Every pipeline can be run step by step in the CivicWorks Lab, with a plain-language explanation of each scene, and every claim is backed by a test.
